# held/props/spoon: a wooden spoon in the right hand and the bowl it eats from in the left (PROPS, P2b) for SitEat and
# SitFloorEat. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. The bowl sits at the left hand's grip (arms/adult/pose man_l hold), the spoon
# at the right's: up to the mouth, down to the bowl.
